# ⚡ EnquiryIQ WhatsApp Automation

AI-powered WhatsApp customer enquiry automation using Google Gemini + Twilio.

## What it does

1. Customer sends WhatsApp message
2. Gemini AI analyses: category, priority, sentiment
3. Auto-reply sent to customer instantly
4. Staff alerted on WhatsApp
5. All enquiries stored and tracked

## Setup Guide

### Step 1 — Get your Gemini API Key (FREE)
1. Go to aistudio.google.com
2. Click "Get API Key"
3. Click "Create API Key"
4. Copy the key

### Step 2 — Get Twilio Test Number (FREE)
1. Go to twilio.com and sign up free
2. Go to Console → Messaging → Try it out → Send a WhatsApp message
3. Follow instructions to join sandbox:
   - Send "join [your-sandbox-word]" to +1 415 523 8886 on WhatsApp
4. Note your Account SID and Auth Token from Console

### Step 3 — Clone and configure
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/enquiryiq-whatsapp.git
cd enquiryiq-whatsapp
npm install
cp .env.example .env
```

Edit .env with your values:
```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=ACxxxxxxxx
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_token
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM=whatsapp:+14155238886
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_TO=whatsapp:+234XXXXXXXXXX
```

### Step 4 — Test locally
```bash
node index.js
```

Test it:
```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/test \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "Adaeze Okonkwo",
    "message": "I ordered 3 items and have not received them. Order #1089",
    "channel": "WhatsApp"
  }'
```

### Step 5 — Deploy to Render
1. Push code to GitHub
2. Go to render.com → New Web Service
3. Connect your GitHub repo
4. Add environment variables
5. Click Deploy
6. Copy your Render URL

### Step 6 — Connect Twilio Webhook
1. Go to Twilio Console → Messaging → Try WhatsApp
2. Set webhook URL to: https://your-render-url.onrender.com/webhook
3. Method: POST
4. Save

### Step 7 — Test live
Send a WhatsApp message to +1 415 523 8886
You should receive:
- Auto-reply from the system
- Staff alert on your phone

## API Endpoints

| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | / | Health check |
| POST | /webhook | Twilio webhook (auto) |
| POST | /test | Manual test |
| GET | /enquiries | View all enquiries |
| GET | /dashboard | Stats summary |
| PATCH | /enquiries/:id | Update status |

## Test Scenarios

### Scenario 1 — Normal Enquiry
```json
{
  "name": "Chidi Obi",
  "message": "What is the price for bulk order of 50 units?",
  "channel": "Website"
}
```

### Scenario 2 — Urgent Complaint
```json
{
  "name": "Emeka Nwosu",
  "message": "My product arrived damaged! I want a refund NOW. This is unacceptable!",
  "channel": "WhatsApp"
}
```

### Scenario 3 — Payment Issue
```json
{
  "name": "Ngozi Adeleke",
  "message": "I made payment yesterday but no confirmation received. Transaction ID: TXN123",
  "channel": "Facebook"
}
```
